  "notes": [
    "Byline 'Corran \"Ganner\" Luke' is a Star Wars character name with no real-name signature, so the deck is credited to the handle Ganner as plain text (no player page).",
    "Starting cards as posted under 'start': MBO/OIAM, HFTMF, Strike Planning and YISYW (followed by '(see stategy)', not a card); they count toward the total. Two Effects start and none is named as the starting Effect, so starting.effect is left empty.",
    "The starting cards are listed again in their sections: the Objective as 'OBJ: MBO/OIAM', 'HFTMF' under interrupts, 'Yo insight serves yo well' and 'plan the strike' (read as Strike Planning) under Effects; these repeats are counted once.",
    "Counted once each, the list totals 61 (65 if the repeats were counted); kept as published.",
    "Posted '+gabber' (a grabber) and 'ship matcher' name no card and are kept as written (UNKNOWN); 'ship matcher' may mean Squadron Assignments.",
    "Posted 'Luke farm' dested Luke Skywalker (Premiere, 'Farmboy Luke'; the strategy flies him in Artoo-Detoo In Red 5); 'LS,RS' dested Luke Skywalker, Rebel Scout; 'Col. crackhead' dested Colonel Cracken; 'Gen. Cal' dested General Calrissian; 'Chewie, pro' dested Chewbacca, Protector; 'Lando /w vibro' dested Lando With Vibro-Ax; 'X-cannon' dested X-wing Laser Cannon.",
    "Posted 'Bac-ta gether tank' dested Bacta Tank; 'Honor of luke' dested Honor Of The Jedi; 'Executor fades' dested Menace Fades (the strategy says 'use manace fades'); 'Run jedi run' dested Run Luke, Run! (named in the strategy); 'Blast the kid, door' dested Blast The Door, Kid!; 'POLR/R combo' dested Path Of Least Resistance & Revealed; 'Wise advise' dested Wise Advice (an Effect in 2001).",
    "Posted 'Death Star' dested the Light Special Edition Death Star system (deploys once the Death Star Plans are completed); 'Kiffex' dested the Light Jabba's Palace Kiffex; 'Yavin 4 Massassi Head' dested Yavin 4: Massassi Headquarters; 'DS trench' dested Death Star: Trench; 'Artoo in/ ship' dested Artoo-Detoo In Red 5.",
    "The strategy says the author will not play the deck until Tatooine (Great Shot, Kid!) is released; no Tatooine card is in the list."
  ],
